$cats['Black & Grey Realism']['Black & Grey Realism Human Emotion'] = @('Two elderly hands clasp tightly with realistic compression where the fingers touch. The brightest skin is reserved for the knuckles while deep shadow separates every overlapping finger','A man sits with his head bowed and elbows resting on his knees. A single overhead light illuminates shoulders and hands while his face remains almost completely hidden','A woman reaches upward into brilliant light while her lower body progressively disappears into shadow','A boxer rests between rounds with sweat running from his face and wrapped hands hanging heavily between his knees. Nothing heroic is posed. The power comes from exhaustion','A woman holds an elderly hand against her cheek with both skin textures rendered distinctly and the point of contact becoming the emotional center','A mans hands cover his eyes while light passes through the narrow spaces between his fingers and illuminates fragments of the face beneath','Two figures embrace in near darkness with faces barely visible while light catches shoulders hands and the pressure of the embrace','A man carries a sleeping child against his shoulder. The childs face receives the softest light while the adult remains largely in shadow','A woman sits at the edge of dark water with her reflection extending beneath her but the reflection carries a subtly different expression','A weathered hand reaches out of darkness toward a younger hand entering brilliant light from the opposite direction')
