$cats['Black & Grey Realism']['Black & Grey Realism Animals From Darkness'] = @('A lion emerges almost invisibly from black shadow. Only the eyes muzzle and selected edges of the mane receive enough light to reveal the animal','A white horse runs through a nearly black environment allowing its illuminated muscles and flying mane to create dramatic contrast','A tiger moves through fog with the nearest eye and muzzle sharply rendered while stripes progressively disappear into atmosphere','A raven opens its wings against brilliant mist reversing the usual composition so the bird becomes the darkest object surrounded by luminous negative space','A wolf stands in moonlit snow with its breath visible in the cold air. Snow becomes the brightest untouched skin while the animal carries the middle and dark values','A leopards face emerges between deep foreground leaves with the eyes and whiskers carrying the highest clarity','A gorilla appears from near-black shadow with one side of the face illuminated enough to reveal skin beneath the fur and extraordinary expression in the eye','An owl flies directly toward the viewer from darkness with dramatic foreshortening and the nearest talons slightly out of focus','A bull lowers its head before charging while dust catches bright side light around its otherwise dark body','A whale rises from nearly black deep water toward a brilliant surface above creating enormous tonal separation and scale')
